      "text": "[9:02PM] #Ogolonto #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is flowing smoothly from Aruna to Ogolonto and Itowolo via Aunty Kenny. \nThe return journey to Majidun is also good, with minor delays near Ogolonto due to traffic alternation. \nHowever, approaching Agric is slow due to traffic navigating Ishawo road and commercial activities. \nThe ferry terminal area is slightly congested at intersections, but traffic is moving. \nIbeshe roundabout to Igbogbo is clear in both directions. \nOjogbe and Ireshe road are busy due to traditional events, but traffic officers are on ground maintaining order.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
