      "text": "[9:13PM] #Apongbon #TrafficUpdate \n \nGood movement on CMS bridge inward Offin Canal market to Ijora Olopa by NEPA intersection.\n\nGood movement on Broad street to Apongbon underneath the bridge to connect Offin Canal market and Olowogbowo.\n\nMovement on Eko bridge inward Apongbon to connect CMS, Elegbeta Mini stadium Ebute-Ero market, Leventist, inner and outer Marina is good.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
